.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
FOR IMPORTER PLUGINS ONLY: The \fBBaseImporter\fP defines a common interface for all importer worker classes\&.
.PP
The interface defines two functions: \fBCanRead()\fP is used to check if the importer can handle the format of the given file\&. If an implementation of this function returns true, the importer then calls \fBReadFile()\fP which imports the given file\&. ReadFile is not overridable, it just calls \fBInternReadFile()\fP and catches any ImportErrorException that might occur\&. 
